Note on data: this license covers the source code, site, and analysis
artifacts (metrics/verdicts in docs/) authored in this repository. It does
NOT grant rights to any third-party literary texts. No literary corpora are
distributed with this repository (see .gitignore and the data-availability
notes in README); texts are referenced by URL and downloaded by fetch/clean
scripts for local validation only. The URL manifest targets authors who died
more than 70 years ago; note that for a few rehabilitated authors (e.g.
Gumilev, Pilnyak) Russian law extends protection from the rehabilitation
date (Art. 1281(5) of the RF Civil Code), so downstream redistribution of
fetched texts is the user's own responsibility.
